Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:08:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] 9923: x86: move hint NOPs to nop_reserved.sinc, add
 PREFETCHRST2/PREFETCHIT0/1

The generic 0F 18-0F 1F hint NOPs were defined before PREFETCHh, MPX and
CET and won over them. Move them to nop_reserved.sinc, included last, add
rm64 variants for REX.W, and label the reserved 0F 18 forms plain NOP.
Add PREFETCHRST2 and PREFETCHIT0/1.

AI-generated by Claude Code.
---
 Ghidra/Processors/x86/certification.manifest    |  1 +
 Ghidra/Processors/x86/data/languages/ia.sinc    | 13 +++++++------
 .../x86/data/languages/nop_reserved.sinc        | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 .../Processors/x86/data/languages/x86.slaspec   |  2 ++
 4 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Ghidra/Processors/x86/data/languages/nop_reserved.sinc

